<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sale at Napier was 448 NZ cents per kg clean versus 438 at the previous sale on May 1, Wools of New Zealand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean), were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - n/a vs 883</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - n/a vs 584</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 381 vs 372</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 404 vs 403</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom +64 4 473 4746</p>
